flowchart TB
  accTitle: Stalwart on Vertex
  accDescr: Three edges and three mail replicas share PostgreSQL durable state and Redis coordination.
  Internet["SMTP peers and mail clients"]
  Edge["3 HAProxy edges, IPv4 + IPv6<br/>PROXY v2: peer address + destination port"]:::edge
  subgraph App["Stalwart 0.16.27, three distinct Kubernetes nodes"]
    direction LR
    A["Mail replica 1"]
    B["Mail replica 2"]
    C["Mail replica 3"]
    A ~~~ B ~~~ C
  end
  SQL["PostgreSQL, 3 instances<br/>Accounts, configuration, mailboxes<br/>Blobs, search, durable delivery queue"]:::durable
  Disk["Encrypted node-local volumes<br/>Synchronous replica acknowledgement"]:::durable
  Redis["Redis + Sentinel, 3 members<br/>Counters, locks, coordinator pub/sub<br/>Asynchronous replication"]:::transient
  Internet --> Edge
  Edge --> App
  App --> Shared["Shared access"]
  Shared -->|"durable data, TLS"| SQL
  Shared <-.->|"coordination"| Redis
  SQL --> Disk

  classDef edge fill:#fff1f2,stroke:#e84d60,color:#172033
  classDef durable fill:#e0f2fe,stroke:#0284c7,color:#172033
  classDef transient fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#172033
